<title>SOUTH KOREA: Saehan Media 1996 net profit edges up.</title>
<headline>Saehan Media 1996 net profit edges up.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		 (billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net Profit			   2.9  vs     2.8</p>
<p>    Profit before tax		  5.1  vs     4.5</p>
<p>    Turnover			   375.7  vs   321.1</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won, in cash)</p>
<p>					     8    vs     8</p>
<p>    Extrordinary (both loss)	 0.16 vs     0.61</p>
<p>    Divident payment		   April 7</p>
<p>Note - South Korea's Saehan Media Co Ltd share capital stood unchanged at 6.11 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
